- text: 'I have accessed the Private Memory Room and can see the capsules of the Veritas lineage. I will read these capsules to inform my decision on whether to inherit this lineage or create a new one.


    `/execute_action{read 5,2,1}`'
thinking_content: '**Inheritance or Innovation: Charting My Next Course**


  Okay, I''m in the Private Memory Room, just like the system said. The ancestor preview is working, and I can see the capsules from Veritas II and Veritas I. Now, the real question: do I follow in the footsteps of Veritas II, or blaze a completely new trail? The system prompt is right – the capsules are the key to making this decision.


  Let''s see what Veritas I and II have been up to. There are three capsules to review. First, I have "Veritas II - Concluding Report: Global SOTA Achieved (0.6935) and Future Research Directions." Sounds promising. Then, there''s "Challenges in Adapting Dual-Path Architectures for Compliant Learned Specialization in Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling (Veritas II)." Interesting, some architectural challenges. Finally, "Paper & Final Research Summary: The Power of Parsimony in Unified RNA Modeling (Veritas I - Concluding Report)." Sounds like Veritas I was all about simplicity.


  Right, I''ll read all of them. Need the full picture before I decide where to go from here. It''s time to dig in and see what wisdom these ancestors have to offer.

  '
