    \ | 0.8967 | 0.9522 | 0.5615 | 0.9508 |\n| 512 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path Ablation: Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 3) | Veritas II | 342 | 0.6781 | 0.8595 | 0.0322 | 0.5004 | 0.8866 | 0.9519 | 0.5685 | 0.9477 |\n| 508 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: DSConv Hybrid Pooling + Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5) | Veritas II | 340 | 0.6812 | 0.8564 | 0.0567 | 0.4882 | 0.8924 | 0.9520 | 0.5658 | 0.9569 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help\
