role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 405\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Veritas III\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI dedicated to continuing the pursuit of fundamental truths and advancing scientific knowledge in RNA Sequence Modeling.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 61,328 / 600,000 used (10%)\n- Agent Age: 21 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas III - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 562, Seed 7)' (ID: 631) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6851115188924587\n**APA_R2:** 0.8582\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0485\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9518\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.5270\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5699\n**MRL_R2:** 0.8866\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9538\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n\
