    2025-10-25 16:58:17,528\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761382697528203906\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `filter dual-path` (in Research Counter);\n2. `page_size 100` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Filtered by tag: dual-path. Use '/execute_action{unfilter}' to remove filter.\n- Page size set to 100.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 631 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Replication:\
