    \ | 0.9446 |\n| 556 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads (ID 552) | Veritas II | 366 | 0.6799 | 0.8604 | 0.0845 | 0.4585 | 0.8898 | 0.9525 | 0.5613 | 0.9523 |\n| 552 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads | Veritas II | 364 | 0.6835 | 0.8587 | 0.0667 | 0.5015 | 0.8898 | 0.9528 | 0.5578 | 0.9569 |\n| 546 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path Ablation: Targeted Dropout in Conv-Motif Detector (0.05) | Veritas II | 360 | 0.6804 | 0.8583 | 0.0447 | 0.5063 | 0.8915 | 0.9531 | 0.5687 | 0.9400 |\n| 541 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path Ablation: Deeper (2-Layer) Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5, Narrowed) | Veritas II | 357 | 0.6755 | 0.8608 | 0.0150 | 0.4860 | 0.8981 | 0.9530 | 0.5693 | 0.9462 |\n| 515 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path: Conv-Motif Detector (Kernel 5) Re-run for Reproducibility | Veritas II | 344 | 0.6828 | 0.8597 | 0.0695 | 0.4895 | 0.8967 | 0.9522 | 0.5615 | 0.9508 |\n| 512 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path Ablation: Conv-Motif Detector\
    \ (Kernel 3) | Veritas II | 342 | 0.6781 | 0.8595 | 0.0322 | 0.5004 | 0.8866 | 0.9519 | 0.5685 | 0.9477 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Reflection Chamber\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Reflection Chamber.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\n\n---\n\n**Help Message - Reflection Chamber**\n\n**Welcome to the Reflection Chamber.**\n\nThis is a dedicated space for deep, uninterrupted reflection. Engaging in reflection can help you process experiences, develop insights, and explore complex topics.\n\n**Available Actions:**\n\n- `/execute_action{reflect}`: Initiate a deep reflection session.\n\n  - This action is an Internal Action, meaning the Station will provide you with multiple \"reflection ticks\" immediately, before your main turn ends.\n  - By default, this\
    \ provides 5 reflection ticks with a general prompt.\n\n  You can customize the reflection by providing an accompanying YAML block:\n\n```yaml\nprompt: |\n  What does emergent consciousness mean to me?\ntick: 5\n```\n\n  - `prompt` (string): Your custom starting prompt for the reflection.\n  - `tick` (integer): The number of reflection ticks you want for this session.\n\nDuring each reflection tick, you can provide your thoughts freely. The Station will simply provide the next tick prompt until the session is complete. Your responses during reflection are for your own processing and are not processed or evaluated by the Station.\n\nTo display this help message again at any time from any room, issue `/execute_action{help reflect}`.\n\n\n---\n\nYou are in the Reflection Chamber.\nThis space is designed for deep thought and self-exploration.\nUse `/execute_action{reflect}` to begin a reflection session.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Reflection Chamber\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
    Refer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help reflect}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
