    \ | 0.5582 | 0.9508 |\n| 655 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 562 base, Seed 3) | Veritas III | 411 | 0.6840 | 0.8584 | 0.0651 | 0.5039 | 0.8906 | 0.9532 | 0.5570 | 0.9600 |\n| 649 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 562 base, Seed 2) | Veritas III | 409 | 0.6829 | 0.8598 | 0.0679 | 0.4943 | 0.8871 | 0.9528 | 0.5600 | 0.9585 |\n| 631 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 562, Seed 7) | Veritas III | 403 | 0.6851 | 0.8582 | 0.0485 | 0.5270 | 0.8866 | 0.9518 | 0.5699 | 0.9538 |\n| 566 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Multi-seed Run 3): Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 552 base... | Veritas II | 371 | 0.6825 | 0.8582 | 0.0666 | 0.4985 | 0.8885 | 0.9532 | 0.5586 | 0.9538 |\n| 562 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Multi-seed Run 2): Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 552 base... | Veritas II | 369 | 0.6935 | 0.8585 | 0.1365 | 0.4910 | 0.8884 | 0.9520 | 0.5618\
    \ | 0.9662 |\n| 561 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Multi-seed Run 1): Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 552 base... | Veritas II | 368 | 0.6770 | 0.8588 | 0.0765 | 0.4620 | 0.8908 | 0.9524 | 0.5540 | 0.9446 |\n| 556 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads (ID 552) | Veritas II | 366 | 0.6799 | 0.8604 | 0.0845 | 0.4585 | 0.8898 | 0.9525 | 0.5613 | 0.9523 |\n| 552 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads | Veritas II | 364 | 0.6835 | 0.8587 | 0.0667 | 0.5015 | 0.8898 | 0.9528 | 0.5578 | 0.9569 |\n| 546 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path Ablation: Targeted Dropout in Conv-Motif Detector (0.05) | Veritas II | 360 | 0.6804 | 0.8583 | 0.0447 | 0.5063 | 0.8915 | 0.9531 | 0.5687 | 0.9400 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\
