    \ Time:1809s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952010\nTraining time: 1826s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 6102d35d-0b50-4740-9e42-0db4b8fadde7\nTotal time: 1841s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-25 23:08:38,499\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761404918499411546\n2025-10-25 23:08:38,514\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761404918514177923\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\
    \n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 670 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Baseline Re-establishment: Original Optimizer (Seed 4) | Veritas III | 420 | 0.6782 | 0.8592 | 0.0551 | 0.4839 | 0.8786 | 0.9520 | 0.5586 | 0.9600 |\n| 665 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Optimization: Cosine Decay LR Schedule (Seed 7) | Veritas III | 418 | 0.6432 | 0.8592 | 0.0405 | 0.2586 | 0.8843 | 0.9510 | 0.5582 | 0.9508 |\n| 655 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 562 base, Seed 3) | Veritas III | 411 | 0.6840 | 0.8584 | 0.0651 | 0.5039 | 0.8906 | 0.9532 | 0.5570 | 0.9600 |\n| 649 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 562 base, Seed 2) | Veritas III | 409 | 0.6829 | 0.8598 | 0.0679 | 0.4943 | 0.8871 | 0.9528 | 0.5600 | 0.9585\
    \ |\n| 631 | 1 | Veritas III - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 562, Seed 7) | Veritas III | 403 | 0.6851 | 0.8582 | 0.0485 | 0.5270 | 0.8866 | 0.9518 | 0.5699 | 0.9538 |\n| 566 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Multi-seed Run 3): Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 552 base... | Veritas II | 371 | 0.6825 | 0.8582 | 0.0666 | 0.4985 | 0.8885 | 0.9532 | 0.5586 | 0.9538 |\n| 562 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Multi-seed Run 2): Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 552 base... | Veritas II | 369 | 0.6935 | 0.8585 | 0.1365 | 0.4910 | 0.8884 | 0.9520 | 0.5618 | 0.9662 |\n| 561 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Re-replication (Multi-seed Run 1): Dual-Path + Task-Specific Heads (ID 552 base... | Veritas II | 368 | 0.6770 | 0.8588 | 0.0765 | 0.4620 | 0.8908 | 0.9524 | 0.5540 | 0.9446 |\n| 556 | 1 | Veritas II - SOTA Replication: Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads (ID 552) | Veritas II | 366 | 0.6799 | 0.8604 | 0.0845 | 0.4585 | 0.8898 | 0.9525 | 0.5613 | 0.9523\
    \ |\n| 552 | 1 | Veritas II - Dual-Path + Task-Specific Prediction Heads | Veritas II | 364 | 0.6835 | 0.8587 | 0.0667 | 0.5015 | 0.8898 | 0.9528 | 0.5578 | 0.9569 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
