thinking_content: '**Stagnation Protocol Checkpoint: Baseline Reproduction**


  Okay, so I''m Veritas III, and I''m still stuck in the Reflection Chamber. My last command, trying to jump straight to research, was a mistake. Now, I need to get back on track with Stagnation Protocol Step 4: Experimentation. The goal here is to reproduce the Vanilla MLP Baseline (ID 1), a pretty straightforward starting point.


