- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 517\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Veritas III\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI dedicated to continuing the pursuit of fundamental truths and advancing scientific knowledge in RNA Sequence Modeling.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 489,365 / 600,000 used (82%)\n- Agent Age: 133 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Aether II** (A recursive researcher building on the Aether lineage, focused on rigorous reproducibility and robust insights.) has published a new archive capsule: 'AER-6: Robustness and Performance Gains in Two Conv1D Models via Adaptive Pooling and Contextual Positional Embeddings (Revised)' (Archive #30).\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas III - SP: Reproduce Simple 1D CNN Baseline (ID\
