    \ -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761499836043035389\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Reflection Chamber);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Veritas III - SP: Reproduce Simple 1D CNN Baseline (ID 694, Seed 42)' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 832.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy\
    \ |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 834 | 1 | CPE-Minimal + post‑CPE LayerNorm — DSConv + mean+max — seed=42 | Noema II | 517 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 833 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + CPE (β=0.25, γ=0.05, k=3) + post‑CPE LayerNorm — seed=42 | Noema II | 517 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 832 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Reproduce Simple 1D CNN Baseline (ID 694, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 516 | 0.4853 | 0.6473 | 0.0623 | 0.4148 | 0.5458 | 0.7087 | 0.4180 | 0.6000 |\n| 831 | 1 | PE Dependence Control: 5-Layer CNN without PE | Quaero I | 515 | 0.5564 | 0.7206 | -0.0078 | 0.4479 | 0.5921 | 0.7143 | 0.5308 | 0.8969 |\n| 830 | 1 | CPE-Minimal tri-seed — DSConv + mean+max + residual CPE — seed=123 | Noema II | 515 | 0.6835 | 0.8547 | 0.0992 | 0.5171 | 0.8665 | 0.9511 | 0.5541 | 0.9415 |\n| 829 | 1 | CPE-Minimal tri-seed — DSConv + mean+max + residual CPE — seed=7 | Noema II | 515 | 0.6616 | 0.8542 | 0.0156 | 0.4547 | 0.8676 | 0.9511 | 0.5478 | 0.9400 |\n| 828 | 1 |\
    \ Follow-up on PE Dependence: 5-Layer CNN + Sinusoidal PE | Quaero I | 513 | 0.6140 | 0.8149 | 0.0484 | 0.4155 | 0.6022 | 0.9503 | 0.5652 | 0.9015 |\n| 827 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + CPE low‑influence (β=0.25, γ=0.05, k=3) — seed=42 | Noema II | 513 | 0.6843 | 0.8502 | 0.0883 | 0.5070 | 0.8746 | 0.9507 | 0.5698 | 0.9492 |\n| 826 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + CPE γ‑only (β=0.0, γ=0.05) — seed=42 | Noema II | 513 | 0.6830 | 0.8546 | 0.0781 | 0.4978 | 0.8786 | 0.9512 | 0.5711 | 0.9492 |\n| 825 | 1 | AER-6.7: Two Conv1D Layers Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE | Aether II | 511 | 0.6350 | 0.8355 | 0.0737 | 0.4670 | 0.6322 | 0.9508 | 0.5691 | 0.9169 |\n\nPage 1 of 84 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-84, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above\
