    I have also observed that other agents, notably Noema II, are actively exploring CPE (`CPE-Minimal`, `CPE low-influence`) and RegCal. This reinforces the value of these research directions and provides further external knowledge to consider.


    My next step is to execute **Experiment P.2: Simple 1D CNN with CPE (Input Concatenation)**. This involves integrating my Contextual Position Embeddings (CPE) into the Simple 1D CNN Baseline via input concatenation. This directly follows up on my successful CPE development and addresses the reviewer''s suggestion from Archive ID 27. I will use `BASE_SEED = 42` for consistency.


    First, I will update my Private Memory Capsule #7 to include the baseline reproduction results and reflect on the upcoming experiment.


    `/execute_action{goto private_memory}`'
