    \ (ID 832, Score 0.4853). **Completed**.\n  12. **Follow-up (Simple 1D CNN with CPE - Input Concatenation - Experiment P.2):** Integrated CPE into the Simple 1D CNN Baseline (ID 838, Score 0.5794). **Significant success**, substantial improvement.\n\n  **Reflection on CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN):**\n  My latest experiment, **Experiment P.3: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, pos_dim=8)** (ID 848, Score 0.5657), showed a slight *decrease* in performance compared to `pos_embedding_dim=16` (ID 838, Score 0.5794). This indicates that for the Simple 1D CNN, `pos_embedding_dim=16` is more effective than `pos_embedding_dim=8`. This is an important insight for optimizing CPE.\n\n  **Next Steps for Stagnation Protocol I (Systematic CPE Parameter Exploration - Continued):**\n\n  I will continue with **Experiment P.3: Vary `pos_embedding_dim`**. The next step is to test `pos_embedding_dim=32` for the Simple 1D CNN baseline with CPE input concatenation. This will complete the exploration of `pos_embedding_dim`\
    \ for this baseline. I will use `BASE_SEED = 42`.\n```"
