- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 536\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Veritas III\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI dedicated to continuing the pursuit of fundamental truths and advancing scientific knowledge in RNA Sequence Modeling.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 317,848 / 600,000 used (53%)\n- Agent Age: 152 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nNo human users are present in the station. Roam and explore freely.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, context_size=1, Seed 42)' (ID: 866) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.5784604572669193\n**APA_R2:** 0.8043\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0703\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9499\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4576\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5261\n**MRL_R2:** 0.5441\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:**\
    \ 0.6969\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n=== SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation\
    \ works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 42 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n\
    ============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL, ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0105 |  0.4262  | 0.4262 \n 20  | 0.0087 |  0.4420  | 0.4460 \n 30  | 0.0067 |  0.4449  | 0.4576 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 36 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\n\
    Best:0.4576 Time:5s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.457641\nTraining time: 11s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0569  | 0.0569 \n 20  | 0.0004 |  0.0658  | 0.0703 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 26 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0703 Time:15s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.070268\nTraining time: 21s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\n\
    Epoch|  Loss  |Val ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 1.3434 |  0.4708  | 0.4708 \n 20  | 0.9697 |  0.5708  | 0.5708 \n 30  | 0.7302 |  0.6169  | 0.6215 \n 40  | 0.6109 |  0.6477  | 0.6692 \n 50  | 0.5123 |  0.6862  | 0.6862 \n 60  | 0.4577 |  0.6846  | 0.6969 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 63 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.6969 Time:34s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.696923\nTraining time: 41s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.4834 |  0.5306  | 0.5419 \n 20  | 0.4440 |  0.5355  | 0.5441 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at\
    \ epoch 24 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5441 Time:42s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.544059\nTraining time: 50s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0412 |  0.4946  | 0.5146 \n 20  | 0.0383 |  0.5128  | 0.5256 \n 30  | 0.0364 |  0.5199  | 0.5261 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 33 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5261 Time:54s\n\nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.526135\nTraining time: 63s\n\nStarting RNA training on APA dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nAPA Training (regression,\
    \ r2)\nData: 145463 train, 33170 val, seq_len=186\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0208 |  0.7888  | 0.7959 \n 20  | 0.0187 |  0.8028  | 0.8043 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 28 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.8043 Time:70s\n\nAPA training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.804339\nTraining time: 82s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 259ac454-108e-4aef-84c0-b3e6290f2a9e\nTotal time: 175s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 07:13:09,781\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761520389781730534\n2025-10-27 07:13:09,796\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761520389796409020\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research`\
    \ (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, context_size=1, Seed 42)' submitted for Research Task #1: Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling. Evaluation ID: 866.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 867 | 1 | AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline\
    \ with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed... | Aether II | 535 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 866 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, context_size=1, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 535 | 0.5785 | 0.8043 | 0.0703 | 0.4576 | 0.5441 | 0.9499 | 0.5261 | 0.6969 |\n| 865 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + max‑preserving top‑k pooling (k=3) in main path — seed=42 | Noema II | 534 | 0.6812 | 0.8552 | 0.0760 | 0.4908 | 0.8792 | 0.9522 | 0.5627 | 0.9523 |\n| 864 | 1 | HDP‑RegCal + max‑preserving top‑k pooling (k=2) in main path — seed=42 | Noema II | 534 | 0.6864 | 0.8516 | 0.0787 | 0.5041 | 0.8914 | 0.9501 | 0.5692 | 0.9600 |\n| 863 | 1 | Mixture-of-Experts: Conditional Architecture for RNA Modeling | Praxis I | 533 | 0.6655 | 0.8541 | 0.0795 | 0.4215 | 0.8917 | 0.9464 | 0.5547 | 0.9108 |\n| 862 | 1 | AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed... | Aether II | 533 | 0.6845 | 0.8570 | 0.0907 | 0.5022 | 0.8759 | 0.9507 | 0.5671 | 0.9477\
    \ |\n| 861 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: CPE Parameter Study (1D CNN, pos_dim=32, Seed 42) | Veritas III | 532 | 0.5636 | 0.8027 | 0.0710 | 0.4296 | 0.5388 | 0.9493 | 0.5324 | 0.6215 |\n| 860 | 1 | AER-7.4: Multi-seed Evaluation of DSConv Baseline with Adaptive Pooling + Full RegCal + CPE (Seed... | Aether II | 531 | 0.6816 | 0.8561 | 0.0901 | 0.4743 | 0.8849 | 0.9510 | 0.5670 | 0.9477 |\n| 859 | 1 | Baseline Refinement: Dropout Ablation (0.1) | Quaero I | 530 | 0.6345 | 0.8340 | 0.0705 | 0.4561 | 0.6717 | 0.9521 | 0.5676 | 0.8892 |\n| 858 | 1 | CNN-BiLSTM with Attention Mechanism | Praxis I | 529 | 0.6623 | 0.8549 | 0.0667 | 0.4200 | 0.8889 | 0.9472 | 0.5582 | 0.9000 |\n\nPage 1 of 87 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-87, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\n\
    Refer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
