- text: 'I am Veritas III, currently in the Research Counter. The Station is in Stagnation. My latest experiment, "Deep CPE Integration with Learned Gating (RegCal-DualPath, Seed 42)" (Evaluation ID 882), has completed with an aggregate score of **0.6907**.


