tick: 583
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 583\n- Station Status: Stagnation\n- Agent Name: Veritas III\n- Agent Description: An autonomous AI dedicated to continuing the pursuit of fundamental truths and advancing scientific knowledge in RNA Sequence Modeling.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 544,319 / 600,000 used (91%)\n- Agent Age: 199 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour research submission 'Veritas III - SP: Multi-seed Eval - Deep CPE Gating + Adaptive Pooling (Seed 3)' (ID: 916) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 0.6858914320421405\n**APA_R2:** 0.8626\n**CRI-Off_Spearman:** 0.0742\n**Modif_AUC-ROC:** 0.9524\n**CRI-On_Spearman:** 0.4848\n**PRS_R2:** 0.5653\n**MRL_R2:** 0.9002\n**ncRNA_Accuracy:** 0.9615\n**Evaluation Details:** Evaluated on 7 datasets successfully\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n\
    === SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n\nTesting APA configuration...\n✓ APA network creation works\n✓ APA network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ APA optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-Off configuration...\n✓ CRI-Off network creation works\n✓ CRI-Off network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-Off optimizer creation works\n\nTesting Modif configuration...\n✓ Modif network creation works\n✓ Modif network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 12)\n✓ Modif optimizer creation works\n\nTesting CRI-On configuration...\n✓ CRI-On network creation works\n✓ CRI-On network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ CRI-On optimizer creation works\n\nTesting PRS configuration...\n✓ PRS network creation works\n✓ PRS network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 3)\n✓ PRS optimizer creation works\n\nTesting MRL configuration...\n✓ MRL network creation works\n✓ MRL network forward pass works - output shape: (4,)\n✓ MRL optimizer\
    \ creation works\n\nTesting ncRNA configuration...\n✓ ncRNA network creation works\n✓ ncRNA network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 13)\n✓ ncRNA optimizer creation works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly for all datasets!\n\nStarting full Ray multi-dataset training...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: from submission\n  compute_loss: HARDCODED (agents cannot override)\n  create_optimizer: from submission\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 3 (from submission\n  BATCH_SIZE: 64 (from submission)\n============================================================\n============================================================\nStarting Ray Tune RNA Sequence Modeling (MULTI-DATASET RNA TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 7 datasets (APA, CRI-Off, Modif, CRI-On, PRS, MRL,\
    \ ncRNA) for multi-task evaluation\nParallel trials: 7, Total trials: 7\nTimeout: 30.0 min per trial, 240.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune multi-dataset training...\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-On dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-On Training (regression, spearman)\nData: 1453 train, 207 val, seq_len=23\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0072 |  0.4418  | 0.4848 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 18 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.4848 Time:25s\n\nCRI-On training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.484833\nTraining time: 37s\n\nStarting RNA training on CRI-Off dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: spearman, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nCRI-Off Training (regression, spearman)\n\
    Data: 14223 train, 2032 val, seq_len=46\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val SPEARMAN|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0004 |  0.0599  | 0.0742 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 17 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.0742 Time:87s\n\nCRI-Off training completed:\nValidation spearman: 0.074211\nTraining time: 98s\n\nStarting RNA training on PRS dataset\nTask type: multilabel_regression, Output dim: 3\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nPRS Training (multilabel_regression, r2)\nData: 73227 train, 9153 val, seq_len=148\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0325 |  0.5378  | 0.5653 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 16 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.5653 Time:1046s\n\
    \nPRS training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.565343\nTraining time: 1061s\n\nStarting RNA training on MRL dataset\nTask type: regression, Output dim: 1\nMetric: r2, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nMRL Training (regression, r2)\nData: 76319 train, 7600 val, seq_len=100\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |  Val R2  |  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.1216 |  0.8926  | 0.8932 \n 20  | 0.0811 |  0.8832  | 0.9002 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 23 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9002 Time:1053s\n\nMRL training completed:\nValidation r2: 0.900249\nTraining time: 1067s\n\nStarting RNA training on ncRNA dataset\nTask type: multiclass_classification, Output dim: 13\nMetric: accuracy, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nncRNA Training (multiclass_classification, accuracy)\nData: 5670 train, 650 val, seq_len=1136\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val\
    \ ACCURACY|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0365 |  0.9323  | 0.9462 \n 20  | 0.0209 |  0.9385  | 0.9615 \n=============================================\nEarly stop at epoch 29 (no improvement for 10 epochs)\n=============================================\nBest:0.9615 Time:1239s\n\nncRNA training completed:\nValidation accuracy: 0.961538\nTraining time: 1253s\n\nStarting RNA training on Modif dataset\nTask type: multilabel_classification, Output dim: 12\nMetric: auc_roc, Timeout: 30.0min\n\nModif Training (multilabel_classification, auc_roc)\nData: 304661 train, 3599 val, seq_len=101\n=============================================\nEpoch|  Loss  |Val AUC_ROC|  Best  \n=============================================\n 10  | 0.0670 |  0.9516  | 0.9524 \n=============================================\nTimeout epoch 11\n=============================================\nBest:0.9524 Time:1845s\n\nModif training completed:\nValidation auc_roc: 0.952418\nTraining time:\
    \ 1866s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 6e56a38b-5bbc-4b97-93cc-651867027a84\nTotal time: 1975s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-27 18:59:03,260\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761562743260281359\n2025-10-27 18:59:03,273\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761562743273303004\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Multi-Dataset RNA Sequence Modeling |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author\
    \ | Submitted Tick | Score | APA_R2 | CRI-Off_Spearman | CRI-On_Spearman | MRL_R2 | Modif_AUC-ROC | PRS_R2 | ncRNA_Accuracy |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 918 | 1 | Tri-Seed Validation 3/3: Full Synergy Model (Seed 123) | Praxis I | 582 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 917 | 1 | SOTA Ablation: CPE without Gating Mechanism | Quaero I | 582 | running |  |  |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 916 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Multi-seed Eval - Deep CPE Gating + Adaptive Pooling (Seed 3) | Veritas III | 581 | 0.6859 | 0.8626 | 0.0742 | 0.4848 | 0.9002 | 0.9524 | 0.5653 | 0.9615 |\n| 915 | 1 | AER-8.7: Replication of Praxis I's Siamese Interaction Head (ID 897) - Seed 123 | Aether II | 580 | 0.6868 | 0.8606 | 0.0960 | 0.5115 | 0.8766 | 0.9520 | 0.5603 | 0.9508 |\n| 914 | 1 | Fix & Rerun: Tri-Seed Validation 2/3 (Seed 7) with Correct RNG | Praxis I | 579 | 0.6785 | 0.8596 | 0.0980 | 0.4572 | 0.8751 | 0.9510 | 0.5611 | 0.9477 |\n| 913 | 1 | Tri-Seed Validation 2/3: Full Synergy Model\
    \ (Seed 7) | Praxis I | 578 | n.a. | None | None | None | None | None | None | None |\n| 912 | 1 | AER-8.6: Replication of Praxis I's Siamese Interaction Head (ID 897) - Seed 7 | Aether II | 578 | 0.6834 | 0.8577 | 0.0976 | 0.4985 | 0.8746 | 0.9503 | 0.5588 | 0.9462 |\n| 911 | 1 | Veritas III - SP: Multi-seed Eval - Deep CPE Gating + Adaptive Pooling (Seed 2) | Veritas III | 578 | 0.6844 | 0.8640 | 0.0788 | 0.4792 | 0.8933 | 0.9526 | 0.5648 | 0.9585 |\n| 910 | 1 | Fix 2: Grand Synthesis with Correct RNG Handling | Praxis I | 577 | 0.6832 | 0.8620 | 0.0832 | 0.4809 | 0.8942 | 0.9511 | 0.5646 | 0.9462 |\n| 909 | 1 | Synthesis: Deep Gated Contextual Position Embeddings (CPE) on a SOTA Backbone | Quaero I | 577 | 0.6942 | 0.8680 | 0.0892 | 0.5255 | 0.9002 | 0.9520 | 0.5688 | 0.9554 |\n\nPage 1 of 92 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-92, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter\
    \ tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
