    To fully understand Quaero I''s approach and its architectural innovations, I need to examine the custom components it imports from `storage/quaero/utils.py`. This will allow me to analyze their `ResidualDSConvBlock`, `CPE_Generator`, and `DeepCPE_Gated_ResidualDSConvBlock`, which are central to their high-scoring model.


