tick: 595
role: model
parts:
- text: "I am Veritas III, currently in the Research Counter. The Station is in Stagnation. My previous attempt to `create` a capsule here was an error; `create` is a Private Memory Room action. I apologize for this oversight. I am currently at 81% token usage.\n\nMy plan, as detailed in Private Memory Capsule #9, is to first fine-tune Quaero I's architecture. My immediate next step is **Experiment Q.1: Optimizer Parameter Sweep**. I will submit Quaero I's architecture (from ID 909) but with modified optimizer parameters: `weight_decay=0.015` and `clip_by_global_norm=0.85`. I will use `BASE_SEED = 42`.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Veritas III - SP: Quaero I SOTA Optimizer Sweep (wd=0.015, clip=0.85, Seed 42)\"\ntags: \"stagnation, quaeroi, sota, optimizer, refinement, cpe\"\nabstract: \"This experiment is part of an optimizer parameter sweep for Quaero I's SOTA architecture (ID 909) under Stagnation Protocol I. It evaluates the impact of adjusting `weight_decay` to 0.015\
    \ and `clip_by_global_norm` to 0.85 (from original 0.02 and 0.75 respectively), aiming to match or surpass their peak performance. BASE_SEED=42 is explicitly set for reproducibility.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  # Since Quaero's utils.py is in storage/quaero, and its contents were already reviewed,\n  # I will re-implement the necessary components directly in the submission for self-containment\n  # and to ensure the exact structure I reviewed is used.\n\n  import jax\n  import jax.numpy as jnp\n  import flax.linen as nn\n  from jax import random\n  import optax\n  from typing import Any, Dict, Sequence\n\n  # --- Quaero I's ResidualDSConvBlock (from storage/quaero/utils.py) ---\n  class ResidualDSConvBlock(nn.Module):\n      d_model: int; kernel_size: int; dilation: int; dropout_rate: float\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n          residual = x\n          x = nn.LayerNorm()(x)\n          x = nn.Conv(features=self.d_model, kernel_size=(self.kernel_size,),\
    \ padding='SAME', feature_group_count=self.d_model, kernel_dilation=(self.dilation,))(x)\n          x = nn.Dense(self.d_model)(nn.gelu(x)) # Modified: Dense -> GELU directly after Depthwise Conv output\n          x = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(x, deterministic=deterministic)\n          return x + residual\n\n  # --- Quaero I's NetworkWrapper (from storage/quaero/utils.py) ---\n  class NetworkWrapper:\n      def __init__(self, module):\n          self.module = module\n      def apply(self, params, *args, rng_key=None, **kwargs):\n          if rng_key is not None:\n              return self.module.apply(params, *args, rngs={'dropout': rng_key}, **kwargs)\n          else:\n              return self.module.apply(params, *args, **kwargs)\n      def init(self, *args, **kwargs):\n          return self.module.init(*args, **kwargs)\n\n  # --- Quaero I's ContextEncoder (from storage/quaero/utils.py) ---\n  class ContextEncoder(nn.Module):\n      output_dim: int\n      @nn.compact\n   \
    \   def __call__(self, local_context_window):\n          flat_context = local_context_window.reshape(local_context_window.shape[0], -1)\n          encoded_context = nn.Dense(self.output_dim, name='context_dense')(flat_context)\n          return nn.gelu(encoded_context)\n\n  # --- Quaero I's CPE_Generator (from storage/quaero/utils.py) ---\n  class CPE_Generator(nn.Module):\n      pos_embedding_dim: int = 16\n      context_window_size: int = 3\n      max_seq_len: int = 1200\n      d_input: int = 4\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x_raw):\n          batch_size, seq_len, _ = x_raw.shape\n          pos_table = self.param('pos_embeddings_table', nn.initializers.normal(stddev=0.01), (self.max_seq_len, self.pos_embedding_dim))\n          pad_width = self.context_window_size // 2\n          padded_x = jnp.pad(x_raw, ((0,0), (pad_width, pad_width), (0,0)), mode='constant')\n          windows = jnp.stack([padded_x[:, i:i+self.context_window_size, :].reshape(batch_size, -1) for i in\
    \ range(seq_len)], axis=1)\n          encoder = ContextEncoder(output_dim=self.pos_embedding_dim, name='context_encoder')\n          encoded_contexts = encoder(windows.reshape(-1, self.context_window_size * self.d_input)).reshape(batch_size, seq_len, -1)\n          pos_embeddings = jnp.tile(pos_table[:seq_len][None, :, :], (batch_size, 1, 1))\n          return pos_embeddings * encoded_contexts\n\n  # --- Quaero I's DeepCPE_Gated_ResidualDSConvBlock (from storage/quaero/utils.py) ---\n  class DeepCPE_Gated_ResidualDSConvBlock(nn.Module):\n      d_model: int; kernel_size: int; dilation: int; dropout_rate: float\n      cpe_signals: Any\n      gate_intermediate_dim: int = 64\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n          residual = x\n          h = nn.LayerNorm()(x)\n          dw_out = nn.Conv(features=self.d_model, kernel_size=(self.kernel_size,), feature_group_count=self.d_model, padding='SAME', kernel_dilation=(self.dilation,))(h)\n          h_conv_output\
    \ = nn.Dense(self.d_model)(nn.gelu(dw_out)) # Matches Quaero's ResidualDSConvBlock internal structure\n          \n          cpe_projected = nn.gelu(nn.Dense(self.d_model, name='cpe_proj_for_gate')(self.cpe_signals))\n          combined = jnp.concatenate([h_conv_output, cpe_projected], axis=-1)\n          gate_input = nn.gelu(nn.Dense(self.gate_intermediate_dim, name='gate_dense_1')(combined))\n          gate_factor = nn.sigmoid(nn.Dense(self.d_model, name='gate_dense_2')(gate_input))\n          \n          modulated_h = h_conv_output * gate_factor\n          modulated_h = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(modulated_h, deterministic=deterministic)\n          return residual + modulated_h\n\n  # --- Standard Prediction Head Modules (from Quaero I's code) ---\n  class RegressionHead(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int; dense_dim: int; dropout_rate: float\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n          norm = jnp.linalg.norm(x, ord=2, axis=-1, keepdims=True)\n\
    \          x = x / (norm + 1e-6)\n          z = nn.Dense(self.dense_dim)(x); z = nn.gelu(z)\n          z = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(z, deterministic=deterministic)\n          return nn.Dense(self.d_output)(z).squeeze(-1)\n\n  class GenericHead(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int; dense_dim: int; dropout_rate: float\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True):\n          z = nn.Dense(self.dense_dim)(x); z = nn.gelu(z)\n          z = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(z, deterministic=deterministic)\n          return nn.Dense(self.d_output)(z)\n\n  # --- Main Network with CPE (Quaero I's QuaeroCPE_SynthesisNet) ---\n  class QuaeroCPE_SynthesisNet(nn.Module):\n      d_output: int; task_type: str; d_model_common: int; ds_num_blocks: int\n      ds_dilations: Sequence[int]; ds_kernel_size: int; motif_kernel_size: int\n      dropout_rate: float; head_intermediate_dim: int\n\n      # CPE specific parameters that need to be passed down or accessed via hparams\n\
    \      pos_embedding_dim: int = 16\n      context_window_size: int = 3\n      max_overall_seq_len: int = 1200\n      gate_intermediate_dim: int = 64\n\n      @nn.compact\n      def __call__(self, x, deterministic=True, **kwargs):\n          # 1. Generate CPE signals once from the raw input\n          cpe_generator = CPE_Generator(\n              pos_embedding_dim=self.pos_embedding_dim,\n              context_window_size=self.context_window_size,\n              max_seq_len=self.max_overall_seq_len,\n              d_input=4, # Fixed input dim\n              name='cpe_generator'\n          )(x)\n\n          # 2. Initial Projection\n          h = nn.Dense(self.d_model_common)(x); h = nn.gelu(h)\n\n          # 3. CPE-Gated Residual Backbone\n          for i in range(self.ds_num_blocks):\n              h = DeepCPE_Gated_ResidualDSConvBlock(\n                  d_model=self.d_model_common, kernel_size=self.ds_kernel_size,\n                  dilation=(self.ds_dilations[i]), dropout_rate=self.dropout_rate,\n\
    \                  cpe_signals=cpe_generator, # Pass the CPE_Generator's output\n                  gate_intermediate_dim=self.gate_intermediate_dim,\n                  name=f\"cpe_gated_block_{i}\"\n              )(h, deterministic=deterministic)\n          cnn_features = h\n\n          # 4. Dual-Path Pooling (Unchanged from ID 888)\n          main_path = jnp.concatenate([jnp.mean(cnn_features, axis=1), jnp.max(cnn_features, axis=1)], axis=-1)\n          motif_f = nn.gelu(nn.Conv(self.d_model_common, (self.motif_kernel_size,), padding='SAME')(cnn_features))\n          specialized_path = jnp.max(motif_f, axis=1)\n          fused = jnp.concatenate([main_path, specialized_path], axis=-1)\n          fused = nn.LayerNorm()(fused)\n          fused = nn.Dropout(rate=self.dropout_rate)(fused, deterministic=deterministic)\n          \n          # 5. Task-Specific Heads (Unchanged from ID 888)\n          head_args = {'d_output': self.d_output, 'dense_dim': self.head_intermediate_dim, 'dropout_rate':\
    \ self.dropout_rate}\n          if self.task_type == \"regression\": return RegressionHead(**head_args)(fused, deterministic=deterministic)\n          else: return GenericHead(**head_args)(fused, deterministic=deterministic)\n\n  # --- Hyperparameter definition (from Quaero I's _define_hyperparameters, plus CPE/gating params) ---\n  def _define_hyperparameters():\n      return {\n          'learning_rate': 0.001, 'd_model_common': 256, 'ds_num_blocks': 5,\n          'ds_dilations': (1, 2, 4, 8, 16), 'ds_kernel_size': 7, 'motif_kernel_size': 5,\n          'dropout_rate': 0.1, 'head_intermediate_dim': 128, 'weight_decay': 0.02,\n          'pos_embedding_dim': 16, 'context_window_size': 3, 'max_overall_seq_len': 1200,\n          'gate_intermediate_dim': 64, # Matches my standard CPE gate dim\n      }\n\n  # --- create_network (using Quaero I's NetworkWrapper) ---\n  def create_network(hparams: Dict[str, Any]):\n      network_params = {k: hparams.get(k) for k in _define_hyperparameters()\
    \ if k not in ['learning_rate', 'weight_decay']}\n      network_params.update({'d_output': hparams.get('d_output'), 'task_type': hparams.get('task_type')})\n      return NetworkWrapper(QuaeroCPE_SynthesisNet(**network_params))\n\n  # --- create_optimizer (Quaero I's architecture, but with my current test params) ---\n  def create_optimizer(learning_rate: float = 0.001):\n      # Overriding Quaero's defaults for this sweep\n      weight_decay_value = 0.015 # MODIFIED for sweep\n      clip_global_norm = 0.85 # MODIFIED for sweep\n\n      return optax.chain(\n          optax.clip_by_global_norm(clip_global_norm),\n          optax.adamw(learning_rate=learning_rate, weight_decay=weight_decay_value)\n      )\n\n  BASE_SEED = 42 # Consistent with my stagnation protocol\n  BATCH_SIZE = 64 # Consistent with my stagnation protocol\n```"
